<title>USA: O'Charley's Inc files share offering.</title>
<headline>O'Charley's Inc files share offering.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Charley's Inc said Thursday it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed 2,000,000 share secondary offering of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the managing underwriters are JC Bradford &amp; Co, Montgomery Securities, and Morgan Keegan &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes and to repay debts.</p>
</text>
